      ],
      "text": "The agent exposes a CLI with flags including --cwd, --model, --host, --ollama-timeout, --resume, --approval, --max-steps, --max-new-tokens, --temperature, and --top-p, with documented defaults such as max-steps 6 and max-new-tokens 512."
